5h-8kvpBpLuG3xZ9zM96dIRlrKyaOvaPvBbAw&oe=6AFB347B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1316677029078314", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574715_1316677032411647_9044766381573892359_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TfFM_Au9tz8Q7kNvwFcbWb_&_nc_oc=AdrXKMz2J0h9lKcQMkucOhv_QrXV9GvsDvweF2i-QHdIWbZhe_AJ0_3JOibi4lylNjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRb5QLtaS2jJ9aLmd7AGPU2xSEDdHDjce4jMoI8B6g5RQ&oe=6AFB2ABA"}, "display_name": "Throwing Punches", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Throwing Punches is a boxing game where you can punch your opponents from a distance. Throw your punches and control them in flight while dodging enemy attacks. It can be a real workout! You can slow down time if the situation gets out of control.\n\nGo through 12 levels consisting of 4 stages each as fast as you can to stand at the top of the leaderboards!\n\nTest yourself in Endless Random mode - whether you clear the stage or not - you never know what comes next!\n\nExperiment with modifiers - make your fists go faster, disable gravity, or change the slow motion controls!\n\nNow with three ways to control slow motion: manual, \"if you move, time moves\" and \"time slows down when bullets are nearby\"", "short_description": "Throwing Punches is a boxing game where you can punch your opponents from a distance. Throw your punches and control them in flight while dodging enemy attacks. It can be a real workout! You can slow down time if the situation gets out of control.\n\nGo through 12 levels consisting of 4 stages each as fast as you can to stand at the top of the leaderboards!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.throwingpunchesvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Enver Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://throwingpunchesvr.co